---
import AppLayout from "../layouts/AppLayout.astro";
import ArigatoLegalLinks from "../components/legal/ArigatoLegalLinks";
---
<AppLayout title="Privacy">
  <article class="legal-doc">
    <h1 class="legal-doc-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-doc-meta">Last updated: 2026 · JobSeen by Arigato Labs</p>
    <p class="legal-doc-lead">
      Plain-language summary of how JobSeen handles your information.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>JobSeen</strong> is a product of <strong>Arigato Labs</strong>, founded by Kumar Devanshu.
      Contact: <a href="mailto:kumardevanshu3001@gmail.com">kumardevanshu3001@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account:</strong> Google sign-in provides email, display name, and photo URL.</li>
      <li><strong>Profile:</strong> username and public profile fields you set in the app.</li>
      <li><strong>App content you create:</strong> job listings, Brute Force leads, walk-in route data, connection requests, chat messages, notification records, and permission settings (e.g. canCopy).</li>
      <li><strong>One Password:</strong> a security question you choose, plus a hashed (digest) answer — not the plain answer — used to protect sensitive edits and deletes.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical:</strong> Firebase / hosting infrastructure may process IP and basic request metadata. We do not run a separate advertising tracker in the app.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How we use data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide JobSeen features (sync jobs, chat, connections, routes).</li>
      <li>Authenticate you and keep accounts secure.</li>
      <li>Enforce permissions (who can see or copy your listings).</li>
      <li>Improve reliability and fix bugs.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Third parties</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google / Firebase</strong> — Authentication and Cloud Firestore.</li>
      <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — static hosting and delivery of the web app.</li>
      <li><strong>Web3Forms</strong> (optional) — only if you submit the Contact form; message delivery to our inbox.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell your personal data.</p>

    <h2>5. Storage &amp; retention</h2>
    <p>
      Primary app data lives in Firebase (cloud) so it syncs across devices.
      You can delete jobs, leads, and related content inside the product where those actions are offered.
      For account-level deletion requests, contact us at the email above.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use reasonable safeguards including Firestore security rules, HTTPS links where required,
      and One Password digests for sensitive actions. No system is perfect — please use a strong Google account
      and treat shared devices carefully.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Children</h2>
    <p>JobSeen is not directed at children under 13. Do not use the service if you are under 13.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy. Continued use after changes means you accept the updated version.
      The “Last updated” line above will change when we revise it.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:kumardevanshu3001@gmail.com">kumardevanshu3001@gmail.com</a>
      or use the <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.
    </p>

    <footer class="legal-doc-footer">
      <ArigatoLegalLinks client:load />
      <p>Copyright &copy; 2026 Arigato Labs. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</AppLayout>
